MMA and rave in one room. Over a year we replaced the ticketing, the door and the fan record, one event at a time.

TSKO6: 1,320 tickets, every one checked in on our door, 752 of them sold on our Portal. £0 platform booking fee: gross collected and remitted in full, card processing at cost. 2.58% all in payment cost, against 8 to 10% before. One door system, every third party buyer reissued.
